# The automatic grid of the prolate kernel with the B-spline window
# (D[prolate-bspline-grid], issue #985): finer than the grid of eq. 15,
# whose error is above the tolerance, and within 0.4 to 1.3 times the
# tolerance on charges at uncorrelated places, in mixed and double precision.
# REQUIRES: python-api
# RUN: rm -rf %t
# RUN: env OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 %mdir_python %S/Inputs/prolate_bspline_grid.py CPU %t | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: CPU tolerance 0.001: the grid of eq. 15
# CHECK: CPU Mixed tolerance 0.001: reciprocal force error
# CHECK: CPU Double tolerance 0.001: reciprocal force error
# CHECK: CPU tolerance 0.0001: the grid of eq. 15
# CHECK: CPU Mixed tolerance 0.0001: reciprocal force error
# CHECK: CPU Double tolerance 0.0001: reciprocal force error
# CHECK: passed
